> | `NATIONAL_REAL_THEN_FIXED_MER` | Construct domestic real GDP, then convert using a base/reference-year exchange rate. |
> | `CURRENT_LCU_TO_ANNUAL_PPP` | Convert each year’s nominal/current-price LCU GDP using annual PPPs. |
> | `NATIONAL_REAL_THEN_FIXED_PPP` | Construct domestic real GDP, then value it with a fixed reference-year PPP. |
> | `PPP_CHAINED_REAL_GDP` | Internationally comparable real GDP series constructed by chain-linking across PPP benchmarks or relative-price structures. |
> | `SOURCE_DEFINED_REAL_GDP_PPP` | PPP-based real GDP measure, but documentation does not support a more precise classification. |
> | `DERIVED_BY_ANALYST` | You construct the series from separately recorded inputs; provide the formula. |
> | `UNKNOWN` | Method not sufficiently documented. |
