> ## Minimal spreadsheet
> 
> | Column | Suggested entries |
> |---|---|
> | `collection_id` | `PWT62_RGDPCH`; `WDI_NY.GDP.PCAP.PP.KD`; `WDI_NY.GDP.PCAP.KD` |
> | `source_version` | `Penn World Table 6.2`; `WDI download 2026-08` |
> | `series` | Source variable name/code and short label |
> | `concept` | `GDPpc`; `GDP`; `other` |
> | `effective_measure_type` | See categories below |
> | `PPP_treatment` | `fixed`; `annual`; `chained`; `none`; `other/unknown` |
> | `price_basis` | `real`; `nominal`; `other/unknown` |
> | `reference_year` | `2005`; `2011`; `2017`; `2021`; `chain/none/unknown` |
> | `growth_definition` | `log change calculated by us`; `source growth rate`; `other` |
> | `coverage` | e.g. `1950–2004, 188 countries` |
> | `notes` | One sentence only, if needed |
