> | `WDI_GDPPC_LCU_CONSTANT` | WDI vintage X | GDP per capita, constant LCU | GDPpc | `national_real` | none | real | country-specific |
> | `GDPPC_CURRENT_USD` | source X | GDPpc, current USD | GDPpc | `annual_MER` | none | nominal | current |
